## GamesApi

### List genrations
## List genrations
GET https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/generation/?limit={{limit}}&offset={{offset}}&q={{q}}
Accept: application/json

### Get genration
## Get genration
GET https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/generation/{{id}}/
Accept: application/json

### List pokedex
## List pokedex
GET https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/pokedex/?limit={{limit}}&offset={{offset}}&q={{q}}
Accept: application/json

### Get pokedex
## Get pokedex
GET https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/pokedex/{{id}}/
Accept: application/json

### List version groups
## List version groups
GET https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version-group/?limit={{limit}}&offset={{offset}}&q={{q}}
Accept: application/json

### Get version group
## Get version group
GET https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version-group/{{id}}/
Accept: application/json

### List versions
## List versions
GET https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/?limit={{limit}}&offset={{offset}}&q={{q}}
Accept: application/json

### Get version
## Get version
